{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-7881457","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年蒙特雷湾水族馆","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"探访蒙特雷湾水族馆，近距离接触企鹅与海獭，见到沙丁鱼群、巨藻森林和神秘海洋生物，收获满满。","date":"2016-10-06","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Monterey Bay Aquarium","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Monterey Bay Aquarium","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7881457.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161009132241id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7881457.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":561,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-7881457/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/001-bb0bacf6a4.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"探访蒙特雷湾水族馆，近距离接触企鹅与海獭，见到沙丁鱼群、巨藻森林和神秘海洋生物，收获满满。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/001-bb0bacf6a4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/001-bb0bacf6a4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n摸摸企鹅Rey！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从酒店开车两个半小时！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我们来到了</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">蒙特雷湾水族馆！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这里紧邻大海！听说原本是一座罐头工厂，后来变成了水族馆！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/003-c5b214f425.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/003-c5b214f425.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n沙丁鱼一边改变队形一边游动着！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n蒙特雷湾\n特殊的环境孕育出的\n巨藻森林\n想让大家看到\n这就是最初的起点，听说是这样！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n如今已经有各种各样的鱼了！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/004-6f88aa26ff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/004-6f88aa26ff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n沙丁鱼有两万条，还和其他鱼一起生活着！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n这里既是水族馆\n\n也是研究所！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n听说他们会保护那些\n受伤或与父母失散的海獭，\n等它们恢复健康后\n再送回大海，\n还会进行各种各样的处理！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/005-470761e614.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/005-470761e614.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"474\"></a></figure>\n\n\n我还获准特别摸了一下正在接受伤情检查的海獭，\n\n软绵绵的！！手感像猫咪一样！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我之前还因为《海底总动员2》里的\n海獭笑个不停……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n没想到现实中的海獭\n也超级超级可爱！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后是\n企鹅！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/006-b726360855.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/006-b726360855.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n我叫着“Rey！Rey！”，它就会过来！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是我人生第一次摸企鹅！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/007-3f1c05951f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/007-3f1c05951f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n身体果然像鸟一样，不过手？摸起来是凉的哦！\n\n<br>\n\n糟了\n企鹅\n好可爱！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/008-7d865b62a0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/008-7d865b62a0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n还有好多水母！\n后台有好多\n小水母！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/009-9ed7db04b2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/009-9ed7db04b2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n有好多从没见过的\n鱿鱼和章鱼！\n真是不可思议的空间！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这次还获准参观了\n蒙特雷湾水族馆的特别区域\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n无论待上几个小时\n都不会看腻的展览\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n被企鹅和海獭治愈了，\n也兴奋不已\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里也是《海底总动员2》的\n故事舞台\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哎呀——\n真是学到了很多\n也深受感动！\n真的太棒了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家去旧金山的时候\n也一定要\n去这里看看哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/001-bb0bacf6a4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/001-bb0bacf6a4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nペンギンのReyちゃんにタッチ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ホテルから車で2時間半！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">やってきました</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">モントレーベイ水族館！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">海に隣接してます！缶詰工場が水族館になったそうです！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/003-c5b214f425.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/003-c5b214f425.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\nイワシが形を変えながら泳いでました！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nモントレーベイの\n特殊な環境で育む\nケルプの森を\nみんなに見せたかったのが\n始まりだそう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいまでは色々な魚たちが！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/004-6f88aa26ff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/004-6f88aa26ff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\nイワシ2万匹と他の魚が一緒にいます！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\nここは水族館であり\n\n研究所でもあります！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n怪我をしたり\n親と離れてしまったラッコを\n保護して\n大丈夫になったら\n海に帰すなど\n様々な対応を行っているそう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/005-470761e614.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/005-470761e614.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"474\"></a></figure>\n\n\n怪我の検査しているラッコに特別にさわらせてもらったけど\n\nふわっふわ！！手は猫のような感じでした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nファインディング・ドリーの\nラッコで笑ってたけど・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n実物のラッコも\nむちゃむちゃかわいかった！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nペンギン！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/006-b726360855.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/006-b726360855.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\nRey！Rey！と呼ぶと来てくれる！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nペンギンにさわったのは\n人生初！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/007-3f1c05951f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/007-3f1c05951f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n身体はやはり鳥のような感じだけど手？は冷たかったよ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nやばい\nペンギン\nかわいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/008-7d865b62a0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/008-7d865b62a0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\nクラゲもたくさん！\nバックヤードは赤ちゃんクラゲが\nたくさんいた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/009-9ed7db04b2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7881457/009-9ed7db04b2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n見たことのない\nイカやタコもたくさん！\n不思議な空間！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今回\n特別な場所も見学させてもらった\nモントレーベイ水族館\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何時間いても\n飽きない展示\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nペンギンとラッコに癒され\n興奮しました\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nファインディング・ドリーの\n舞台にもなった場所\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいやー\n勉強になりました\n感動しました！\n本当に素晴らしかった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさんも\nサンフランシスコに行った際には\nぜひ\n足を運んでみてくださいね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br></div>"}}